   {"t":"fill","q":"This oven is old, but ___ (它) works well.","a":["it"],"e":"oven 是東西，單數，代名詞用 it。"},
   {"t":"tr","zh":"他們很友善。","a":["They are friendly.","They’re friendly.","They're friendly."],"e":"「他們」是複數，用 They，be 動詞用 are。friendly 是形容詞。"}
