   {"t":"fill","q":"Sorry, there ___ (be + not) any bread today.","a":["is not","isn’t","isn't"],"e":"bread 是不可數名詞，用 is；否定是 is not / isn’t。"},
   {"t":"fix","q":"改錯：Have there any tomatoes?","o":["Are there any tomatoes?","Is there any tomatoes?","Are there any tomato?"],"a":0,"e":"There 句型的疑問句用 be 動詞，不用 have；tomatoes 是複數，所以用 Are there any tomatoes?。"},
   {"t":"tr","zh":"這附近有超市嗎？","a":["Is there a supermarket near here?","Is there a supermarket nearby?","Is there a supermarket around here?"],"e":"一間超市是單數，用 Is there a ...?。near here / nearby 表示這附近。"},
   {"t":"mc","q":"A: Are there any chairs? B: No, there ___.","o":["isn’t","aren’t","don’t","haven’t"],"a":1,"e":"問句用 Are there，回答也用 are：No, there aren’t.。"}
